/**
 * R19 — the 72 workspace visuals (primary + secondary of each of the 36 workspaces, design contract
 * r19/contract.generated.json) as Core Dashboard Designer data (src/lib/dashboards: shapes bridge / target / grid /
 * cumulative / xy / profile / schedule / hierarchy / board and the base shapes). Every point carries the drill to
 * the records it sums. A visual whose source the snapshot lacks is `unavailable` with its reason — never drawn
 * from invented data.
 */
